
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

    <!-- $title = SHOWROOM-X.txt -->
    <!-- $desc = A sophisticated Brand Identity and creative platform that connected Showroom-X with a Chinese audience, and showcased our uniquely Australian approach to high consumer fashion. -->

    <!-- @import '../head.kit' -->

    <body class="">

        <!-- @import '../header.kit' -->

        <div class="main">
            <div class="project-intro typewriter">
                <div class="project-intro-inner">
                    <h1 class="project-title" data-chars="1" data-speed="50">Showroom-X</h1>
                    <hr>
                    <div class="project-details-wrapper">
                        <div class="project-details">
                            <h2>Client</h2>

                            <p>Showroom-X</p>

                            <h2>Involvement</h2>

                            <p>Brand Identity</p>
                            <p>Brand Guidelines</p>
                            <p>Brand Implementation </p>
                            <p>Website Design</p>
                            <p>Launch Video</p>
                            <p>Animation</p>

                            <div class="awards">
                                <h2>Recognition</h2>

                                <p>PADC Skull Awards 2021 Bronze — Brand Scheme Below $20,000</p>

                                <div class="awards-logos wait-for-typewriter">
                                    <img alt="PADC Skull" title="PADC Skull" src="/assets/award-skull.svg">
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="project-description">
                            <h2>Challenge</h2>
                            <p>We worked with Showroom-X to launch an exclusive online retail fashion brand to the Chinese market at a time when the retail landscape is changing. In Australia, the failure rate for retailers has reached 1.5X the national average compared to all sectors, while 1 in 10 purchases in Australia is now made online. Brands operating in Australia are experiencing the constraints of a market at saturation point. </p>
                            <h2>Solution</h2>
                            <p>I worked with Showroom-X to develop a sophisticated Brand Identity and creative platform for launch that connected Showroom-X with a Chinese audience. It was created using a contemporary Australian aesthetic in line with the high-end Australian product offering. The Brand Identity was developed to bring to life an international feel with our unique Australian accent. I also developed a website concept and created an investor presentation video.</p>
                            <p>The key deliverable after creation of the brand identity was the comprehensive planning and design of the website across mobile and desktop platforms.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="project-description">
                            <h2>Results</h2>
                            <p>Showroom-X beat their first-round funding targets. At 2019 Paris Fashion Week, Showroom-X signed up their remaining targeted Australian designers – in some cases those who stock their product on no other online portal. They have now evolved into WeWearAustralian and have a store in SoHo New York City.</p>
                            <p><a href="https://showroom-x.com/" target="_blank" class="dotted after-arrow">Visit the website</a></p>
                            <p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Jsmbum6aJsw" target="_blank" class="dotted after-arrow">Watch the video</a></p>
                            <div class="collab-logos wait-for-typewriter">
                                <img alt="Cameron Murray" title="Cameron Murray" src="/assets/logo-cameron-murray.svg">
                                <img alt="Block Branding" title="Block Branding" src="/assets/logo-block.svg">
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="project-content">
                <div class="square-wrapper">
                    <video autoplay loop muted playsinline>
                      <source src="images/showroomx-video-1.webm" type="video/webm">
                      Your browser does not support the video tag.
                    </video>
                </div>

                <div class="expandable"><img src="images/showroomx-1.webp"></div>
                <div class="expandable"><img src="images/showroomx-3.webp"></div>
                <div class="expandable"><img src="images/showroomx-10.webp"></div>

                <div class="video-embed-wrapper">
                    <iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/Jsmbum6aJsw?si=hbFzK78Zyia_X-Jl" title="YouTube video player" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen></iframe>
                </div>

